WEBVTT

01:51.000 --> 01:53.560
We're at the illegal internet cafe!
Everyone, pull yourself together!

01:54.080 --> 01:54.920
Lead the way.

01:58.600 --> 02:01.880
LAVISH GIFTS, GENEROUS FREEBIES

02:03.560 --> 02:06.280
LIANG LIANG COMPUTER SUPPLIES

02:07.680 --> 02:09.560
All of them. Take them away!

02:09.639 --> 02:10.880
Get up! Move!

02:12.080 --> 02:13.000
Hurry up! Move!

02:13.520 --> 02:15.320
Hold on. This is a misunderstanding.

02:15.400 --> 02:16.320
You've made a mistake.

02:16.400 --> 02:18.000
We have all the required licenses.

02:18.080 --> 02:19.720
This is a legit internet cafe. Hold on.

02:19.800 --> 02:20.800
This is a misunderstanding.

02:21.600 --> 02:23.080
-Hold on.
-Are you the boss?

02:23.160 --> 02:24.680
This is an important suspect.
Take him away.

02:25.280 --> 02:26.320
No.

02:27.080 --> 02:28.560
Mr. He, I'm just helping out.

02:28.640 --> 02:30.920
Help me! Help me!

02:33.520 --> 02:35.880
Why are you taking all these people back?

02:35.960 --> 02:37.520
Are these people related to the case?

02:37.600 --> 02:38.760
He Yuanhang.

02:40.080 --> 02:40.920
Are you sober?

02:41.560 --> 02:42.800
Listen carefully.

02:42.880 --> 02:44.480
The Special Task Force is in charge here.

02:44.560 --> 02:46.520
You are an unrelated person.
Go back and rest.

02:47.320 --> 02:48.240
-Why should I?
-Dad,

02:49.080 --> 02:50.880
this is an investigation scene.
Don't cause any trouble.

02:50.960 --> 02:52.240
Whose side are you on?

02:54.600 --> 02:56.320
Officer, two days ago,

02:56.400 --> 02:59.400
the trolley for moving stocks was stolen.

03:00.600 --> 03:02.640
-Are you going to help us?
-Go to the police station.

03:02.720 --> 03:04.000
We're from the criminal department.

03:04.080 --> 03:05.680
-You are all police officers.
-Go away.

03:07.000 --> 03:08.160
You've forgotten your true mission.

03:08.240 --> 03:10.680
You have forgotten where you came from.

03:10.760 --> 03:12.040
Everyone!

03:12.120 --> 03:15.040
Search every corner
using Captain Ran's Tremaux Algorithm.

03:15.120 --> 03:17.600
Don't miss anything,
not even a screw! You hear me?

03:18.480 --> 03:20.640
Tremaux Algorithm? You?

03:27.280 --> 03:29.800
Officer! You're framing me!

03:29.880 --> 03:31.760
-I'm innocent! Officer!
-Zheng Zhong!

03:31.840 --> 03:33.240
Put that man with the hood in my car!

03:33.840 --> 03:35.840
Hurry!

03:43.640 --> 03:45.240
-Captain Qu.
-What is it?

03:45.320 --> 03:46.160
Which car am I getting on?

03:47.360 --> 03:49.240
Han Zi'ang's case is investigated
by the Special Task Force now.

03:49.320 --> 03:51.160
You are no longer needed.
Send your father home.

03:51.240 --> 03:52.160
Let's go.

04:22.880 --> 04:25.120
PUBLIC SECURITY

04:25.200 --> 04:26.120
Understood.

04:26.640 --> 04:27.560
Yes.

04:28.400 --> 04:29.240
I'll surely complete this mission.

04:29.840 --> 04:30.760
Goodbye, sir.

04:31.560 --> 04:33.600
I just received orders
from the city council.

04:33.680 --> 04:35.520
The case of the four
teenagers' disappearance

04:35.600 --> 04:37.880
will be investigated
by the Nanshan Branch.

04:38.600 --> 04:40.120
With Han Zi'ang's case,

04:40.800 --> 04:41.640
it is…

04:42.720 --> 04:43.760
It is now…

04:43.840 --> 04:44.640
FOUR MISSING TEENAGERS CASE

04:45.320 --> 04:46.600
FIVE MISSING TEENAGERS CASE

04:47.800 --> 04:48.760
…Five Teenagers Case.

04:51.760 --> 04:53.800
Captain Qu, they are looking for you.

04:53.880 --> 04:54.880
Go downstairs and take a look.

04:57.480 --> 04:59.480
Dad, calm down.

04:59.560 --> 05:01.280
I've accepted the decision
not to be in the Special Task Force.

05:01.360 --> 05:03.520
-I won't accept it!
-He Yuanhang.

05:04.160 --> 05:05.080
Do you know what this place is?

05:06.480 --> 05:07.320
Qu Dahai.

05:07.400 --> 05:09.480
Xiaohe contributed to the case.

05:09.560 --> 05:11.520
Why can't she join the task force?

05:11.600 --> 05:12.440
He Yuanhang,

05:12.520 --> 05:14.600
merging the case is a decision
made by the superiors.

05:14.680 --> 05:17.280
Besides, Xiaohe has never been
a part of the task force.

05:17.360 --> 05:19.880
The case involves the kidnapping
of teenagers now.

05:19.960 --> 05:22.160
She experienced something similar,
so she isn't fit to join the task force.

05:22.240 --> 05:24.160
Who are you to decide that?

05:24.240 --> 05:26.320
She is Ran's direct apprentice.

05:26.400 --> 05:28.800
Not trusting her
means you are not trusting Ran.

05:30.200 --> 05:31.840
How dare you mention Captain Ran?

05:32.520 --> 05:33.360
Back then,

05:33.440 --> 05:35.520
if you hadn't burdened
Captain Ran excessively

05:35.600 --> 05:37.720
by letting him take care
of the whole family,

05:37.800 --> 05:38.760
would that have happened to him?

05:38.840 --> 05:40.000
-What?
-How dare you

05:40.080 --> 05:42.520
still mention Captain Ran's name
around here?

05:42.600 --> 05:45.200
I'm telling you.
You are responsible for his death!

05:45.280 --> 05:46.760
-What?
-What's going on?

05:46.840 --> 05:47.800
We can't stop him…

05:54.720 --> 05:56.920
What's wrong? Dad! Dad!

07:05.160 --> 07:07.240
Tonight at 7:30 p.m. Beijing Time,

07:07.320 --> 07:08.440
the 2002 World Cup match

07:08.520 --> 07:11.520
kicks off between China and Brazil.

07:11.600 --> 07:14.960
Testing, silly testing…

07:15.040 --> 07:17.360
IMPROVING SALES
MANAGING RISKS FOR WIN-WIN SITUATIONS

07:17.440 --> 07:18.800
ANPING INSURANCE, PROTECT YOUR SAFETY

07:18.880 --> 07:21.240
The times are progressing.

07:23.120 --> 07:26.320
Even our football team
has qualified for the World Cup.

07:26.400 --> 07:28.400
How can we still slack?

07:28.480 --> 07:31.120
We need to change our mindset

07:31.200 --> 07:32.280
and the way we speak.

07:34.320 --> 07:35.600
Come and tell everyone

07:35.680 --> 07:38.400
what our core competency is.

07:38.480 --> 07:40.440
Do we even have any?

07:40.520 --> 07:43.240
We're just eating, drinking,
and entertaining our clients.

07:43.320 --> 07:44.320
Also, we lose money.

07:45.240 --> 07:47.920
What's so funny?

07:48.000 --> 07:49.960
I've trained you all for half a year

07:50.040 --> 07:51.280
and you have retained nothing.

07:51.880 --> 07:53.360
You're the fool who knows nothing.

07:53.440 --> 07:54.880
Gosh.

07:59.520 --> 08:00.560
Stand up.

08:01.640 --> 08:02.760
Turn.

08:05.640 --> 08:07.440
Anping Insurance.

08:08.080 --> 08:10.320
-Protects your safety.
-Protects your safety.

08:17.880 --> 08:19.360
Seriously, you're the security team.

08:20.040 --> 08:21.760
Why didn't you submit

08:21.840 --> 08:22.880
the property owner's lost camera?

08:22.960 --> 08:24.840
You even used it to take random pictures.

08:24.920 --> 08:26.000
All of you will be in trouble

08:26.080 --> 08:26.920
if the property owner reports
it to the police.

08:27.680 --> 08:29.480
I asked them to take the pictures.

08:29.560 --> 08:31.440
Those are all pictures of the scene.

08:31.520 --> 08:33.360
I want to keep it as evidence.

08:33.440 --> 08:34.880
The police often do this
when they investigate a case.

08:34.960 --> 08:36.400
Shut up!

08:36.480 --> 08:38.919
Do you really think
you are working as a police officer

08:39.000 --> 08:40.480
after assisting them for a few days?

08:40.559 --> 08:43.320
Don't forget who your boss is
in Yuanlongli.

08:46.400 --> 08:47.360
Officer Ran.

08:47.440 --> 08:48.720
Welcome.

08:49.240 --> 08:50.240
How can I help you?

08:51.600 --> 08:54.480
Mr. Qian,
what has Wu Shanlong of Unit 1703

08:54.560 --> 08:57.080
been up to recently in Yuanlongli?

08:59.480 --> 09:00.400
Him?

09:00.920 --> 09:04.160
He usually helps the management body out

09:04.240 --> 09:05.760
by doing electrical work
and fixing internet cables

09:05.840 --> 09:07.680
on a part-time basis.

09:07.760 --> 09:10.280
He's just trying to make a living.

09:10.360 --> 09:11.880
His charges are cheap.

09:11.960 --> 09:14.200
Most of the time, he helps us for free.

09:14.720 --> 09:17.440
Wu Shanlong has a fetish.

09:17.520 --> 09:18.840
He can't have intercourse,

09:18.920 --> 09:21.800
but he likes to keep women's garments

09:21.880 --> 09:23.720
and peek at women's bodies from afar.

09:23.800 --> 09:24.880
For some reason,

09:24.960 --> 09:27.560
I've always felt a gaze at midnight.

09:27.640 --> 09:28.920
It creeps me out.

09:29.000 --> 09:30.360
We live in 1713.

09:30.440 --> 09:31.920
The clothes I hung out to dry

09:32.000 --> 09:33.560
and my shoes at the door
were all stolen by him.

09:33.640 --> 09:36.800
We complained to management,
but Qian Dajun didn't even care.

09:36.880 --> 09:39.200
Everyone else in the building
couldn't run any business here.

09:39.280 --> 09:40.880
He forced them out.

09:49.800 --> 09:50.880
Can I borrow this?

09:50.960 --> 09:52.400
Go ahead.

09:52.480 --> 09:53.560
By my guest.

09:54.720 --> 09:55.840
Thank you.

09:56.640 --> 09:58.200
Officer Ran, let me send you off.

09:59.640 --> 10:01.000
Take care.

10:04.160 --> 10:05.440
ANPING INSURANCE, PROTECT YOUR SAFETY

10:05.520 --> 10:06.840
1997?

10:08.760 --> 10:09.880
Back then,

10:09.960 --> 10:14.240
Mr. Jin met Wu Shanlong
and wanted to change his business.

10:14.320 --> 10:16.600
In the end, he started a gambling den.

10:16.680 --> 10:19.720
Later, the gambling den
was raided by the police.

10:19.800 --> 10:22.760
Mr. Jin ran away.
He is still missing right now.

10:22.840 --> 10:25.800
I was just a lackey who helped out.

10:25.880 --> 10:28.160
I was jailed for two years.

10:28.240 --> 10:30.640
Isn't it too much for me, Officer He?

10:30.720 --> 10:32.320
It had nothing to do with me.

10:38.640 --> 10:40.280
What was the relationship
between Wu Shanlong

10:40.360 --> 10:41.880
and the father and daughter
who went missing in 1997?

10:43.320 --> 10:44.640
I don't know.

10:45.440 --> 10:47.560
I only interacted with Wu Shanlong once.

10:48.360 --> 10:49.320
However,

10:49.400 --> 10:51.160
Wu Shanlong did go to find Wolf.

10:52.680 --> 10:55.600
He wanted Wolf to help him kill

10:56.400 --> 10:57.400
those two people.

10:57.480 --> 10:59.680
However, Wolf failed.

10:59.760 --> 11:01.720
Later, Wu Shanlong said

11:02.360 --> 11:05.360
he went and did the deed himself.

11:08.280 --> 11:09.480
He said that himself?

11:09.560 --> 11:11.640
Yes. He said it himself.

11:11.720 --> 11:12.680
I swear I'm not lying.

11:43.280 --> 11:45.680
Ran, you scared me. It's so late at night.

11:45.760 --> 11:48.520
Didn't you say you felt
someone's gaze at night?

11:51.200 --> 11:53.800
Ran, you're scaring me.

11:53.880 --> 11:54.960
Keep quiet.

11:57.720 --> 11:58.560
Go inside,

11:59.120 --> 12:00.160
turn off the lights,

12:00.840 --> 12:01.840
and open the curtains.

12:02.360 --> 12:03.280
Leave the door open for me.

12:38.640 --> 12:39.480
Come.

13:15.040 --> 13:16.080
HE

13:17.600 --> 13:18.600
Hey.

13:18.680 --> 13:20.280
I have got something huge.

13:20.360 --> 13:22.760
Jin Manshan's lackey can prove

13:22.840 --> 13:25.760
that Wu Shanlong said
he did the deed himself.

13:26.520 --> 13:28.960
Wu Shanlong killed Xu Meng and her father?

13:29.040 --> 13:30.800
That's right.
What's the situation over there?

13:30.880 --> 13:32.240
I found a secret camera

13:32.320 --> 13:34.040
at New York Block Unit 415.

13:34.120 --> 13:35.760
I suspect it was Wu Shanlong
who installed it.

13:36.800 --> 13:38.160
That punk.

13:38.240 --> 13:39.280
He tried to harm Qiao?

13:40.080 --> 13:41.920
Well, gather the evidence.

13:42.000 --> 13:44.160
I'll rush over immediately.
We must catch him red-handed.

13:44.240 --> 13:45.160
All right.

14:04.760 --> 14:05.640
Sorry.

14:11.680 --> 14:13.240
-Seriously? I was watching a show!
-What the hell?

14:13.320 --> 14:14.680
This stupid management body.
What are they doing?

14:14.760 --> 14:15.960
-A blackout?
-I don't even know what's going on.

14:16.040 --> 14:17.440
-What are they doing?
-So annoying.

14:23.800 --> 14:25.320
Qian Dajun!

14:26.080 --> 14:27.080
Officer Ran.

14:27.960 --> 14:28.840
I can only cut the power

14:28.920 --> 14:29.920
-for ten minutes at most.
-Shush.

14:30.000 --> 14:31.600
Got it.

14:32.520 --> 14:34.480
The match of the century will begin soon.

14:34.560 --> 14:37.720
If the residents can't watch
the match, my head will roll.

14:38.360 --> 14:40.240
-Hurry up.
-I understand.

14:48.120 --> 14:49.680
Ran, be careful.

15:00.160 --> 15:01.040
Ran!

15:01.120 --> 15:03.240
Ran, install the camera again.
You're spooking the culprit.

15:19.000 --> 15:20.960
Those property management imbeciles.

15:21.040 --> 15:22.880
Why aren't they picking up?

15:24.960 --> 15:26.040
Qian!

15:26.120 --> 15:28.560
I'm going to dig up your ancestor's grave!

15:28.640 --> 15:31.480
I risked my reputation
to work with all of you.

15:31.560 --> 15:32.400
Shut up.

15:44.600 --> 15:46.360
What is your kid doing again?

15:47.480 --> 15:49.200
-Why are you…
-Shush.

15:52.200 --> 15:55.480
He, should we call the police station
and request backup?

15:55.560 --> 15:56.600
No need.

15:56.680 --> 15:58.560
It'll only cause more trouble.
Let's deal with this quickly.

15:58.640 --> 15:59.480
Good idea.

15:59.560 --> 16:00.520
A reminder.

16:00.600 --> 16:02.560
I have to restore the power
in two minutes.

16:03.840 --> 16:05.000
Ran.

16:05.640 --> 16:06.560
We also want to help.

16:06.640 --> 16:07.640
We'll beat the pervert up!

16:07.720 --> 16:09.600
-Yes.
-Exactly. Beat him to death.

16:14.920 --> 16:16.760
Help Ma Qiang and Wang Xinglong
guard the elevator and door

16:16.840 --> 16:18.200
on the first floor.

16:18.280 --> 16:19.320
If you see Wu Shanlong,

16:19.400 --> 16:21.320
don't force yourself,
and call me immediately.

16:21.920 --> 16:22.880
All right.

16:30.440 --> 16:32.640
Wu, are you inside?

16:34.720 --> 16:37.960
The municipality was relocating
the utility lines just now.

16:38.040 --> 16:40.520
Someone's electricity meter
short-circuited.

16:40.600 --> 16:41.920
I came by to check.

17:39.880 --> 17:42.200
Is he inside the room?

17:49.800 --> 17:52.800
Wu Shanlong! Police! Open the door!

18:29.760 --> 18:31.400
DOUBLE FISH

18:32.680 --> 18:33.520
He.

18:52.160 --> 18:53.720
It's warm. He just left.

18:53.800 --> 18:54.680
Walkie-talkie.

18:56.400 --> 18:57.800
Ma Qiang.

18:58.640 --> 18:59.800
Do you see Wu Shanlong?

18:59.880 --> 19:02.280
Sir, I didn't see him. No.

19:03.280 --> 19:05.880
Qiao, do you see Wu Shanlong over there?

19:06.400 --> 19:08.440
Ran, we didn't see him, either.

19:20.040 --> 19:21.320
Wu Shanlong might be
in the underground parking lot.

19:21.400 --> 19:23.760
Ran, take the elevator

19:23.840 --> 19:26.080
and go outside. Intercept him
at the parking lot entrance.

19:26.160 --> 19:28.040
I'll go after him using the stairs.
We'll corner him.

19:30.480 --> 19:32.360
Is there anything I can help with?

20:17.480 --> 20:19.320
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

20:29.240 --> 20:30.000
Get lost.

20:38.200 --> 20:39.080
Wu Shanlong!

20:40.280 --> 20:41.160
Stop!

20:54.000 --> 20:54.840
What the heck?

21:03.480 --> 21:04.320
Is this his car?

21:05.520 --> 21:08.040
He! He's here!

21:08.640 --> 21:11.240
I've locked the door to the stairs!
Are there any more exits?

21:11.320 --> 21:12.600
The parking lot entrance.

21:13.120 --> 21:15.960
The parking lot entrance
was opened last week!

21:16.040 --> 21:18.160
He might be able to exit from there!

21:20.600 --> 21:21.640
Stop!

21:22.720 --> 21:23.760
Catch him!

21:27.200 --> 21:28.840
Move! Move!

21:29.840 --> 21:31.040
Move!

21:31.120 --> 21:32.600
What are you doing?

21:33.640 --> 21:34.560
He went that way!

22:25.760 --> 22:26.880
After him!

23:40.720 --> 23:41.720
He!

23:44.040 --> 23:44.960
He!

23:47.960 --> 23:49.040
He!

23:54.320 --> 23:55.160
He!

23:58.920 --> 24:00.400
Quick, call an ambulance!

24:01.520 --> 24:03.120
Stay awake, He!

24:07.840 --> 24:08.680
He!

24:10.080 --> 24:11.360
Stay awake, He!

24:21.000 --> 24:22.320
He!

24:54.120 --> 24:56.080
The steel rod pierced his lung

24:56.160 --> 24:57.400
and broke his rib.

24:58.080 --> 25:00.360
Thankfully, Officer He is lucky.

25:00.440 --> 25:01.360
A few centimeters above,

25:02.600 --> 25:04.200
and it'd have pierced his heart.

25:04.280 --> 25:05.880
The consequences could've been worse.

25:06.880 --> 25:09.240
You must do your best to treat him.

25:09.920 --> 25:11.920
There mustn't be any complications.

25:12.520 --> 25:15.600
He is the hero of the police force.

25:15.680 --> 25:16.600
Don't worry.

25:17.480 --> 25:18.600
Thank you.

25:27.520 --> 25:28.440
Sir!

25:31.520 --> 25:32.440
Sir!

25:36.240 --> 25:37.200
Sir!

25:43.400 --> 25:45.000
Are you all right, sir?

25:54.400 --> 25:55.280
He.

25:59.160 --> 26:01.760
He. Are you all right, He?

26:08.320 --> 26:09.160
FOLDER

26:10.760 --> 26:12.560
-Be careful.
-Be careful.

26:18.080 --> 26:19.160
Dad.

26:22.680 --> 26:23.720
I'm fine.

26:25.560 --> 26:26.400
Are you really fine?

26:27.320 --> 26:29.320
I said I'm fine.

26:34.120 --> 26:35.080
Anyway, He,

26:35.160 --> 26:38.280
why did you suddenly think
of bringing Xiaohe

26:38.360 --> 26:40.280
to Yuanlongli's internet cafe
to search for clues?

26:41.560 --> 26:43.600
Ran brought us there.

26:54.160 --> 26:55.000
Ran.

26:55.080 --> 26:57.320
Don't just stand there.

26:57.840 --> 26:59.360
Tell everyone about it.

27:01.200 --> 27:02.080
No way.

27:07.200 --> 27:08.480
Yes.

27:08.560 --> 27:10.640
Did you hear what he just said?

27:12.600 --> 27:15.760
I… What did he just say?

27:15.840 --> 27:17.840
Stop playing dumb.

27:20.000 --> 27:21.240
He was scolding you.

27:21.320 --> 27:23.520
He said you were biased towards Qu Dahai.

27:24.120 --> 27:26.080
Xiaohe found the lead,

27:26.680 --> 27:28.520
but you gave Qu Dahai the case

27:28.600 --> 27:31.000
and even stopped Xiaohe
from joining the task force.

27:31.080 --> 27:34.200
Is the criminal department
trying to steal credit too?

27:34.720 --> 27:35.520
Captain,

27:35.600 --> 27:37.160
I did it for Xiaohe's sake.

27:37.240 --> 27:40.320
Wasn't Xiaohe kidnapped
when she was a child?

27:40.400 --> 27:42.280
I was afraid that she
might relive those memories

27:42.360 --> 27:43.560
after joining the task force.

27:43.640 --> 27:46.120
What if it triggered… What you call it…

27:46.200 --> 27:48.760
Hush. I can't hear him.

27:55.920 --> 27:56.760
You hear that?

27:56.840 --> 27:58.080
He's scolding you.

27:58.840 --> 27:59.680
Are you talking to me?

27:59.760 --> 28:01.600
Captain Ran said

28:01.680 --> 28:04.240
the internet cafe owner you arrested

28:04.320 --> 28:07.120
wasn't a kidnapping suspect.

28:07.200 --> 28:09.760
You are only wasting your time
by interrogating him.

28:09.840 --> 28:13.920
Also, Ran taught you
the Tremaux Algorithm.

28:14.000 --> 28:16.120
Shouldn't you provide guidance
to Xiaohe now?

28:19.760 --> 28:21.040
Dad,

28:21.120 --> 28:23.160
you've had a long day.

28:23.240 --> 28:24.080
Let's go home.

28:25.320 --> 28:27.760
Uncle Ran still has a train to catch.

28:49.680 --> 28:50.520
He Xiaohe.

28:51.400 --> 28:52.240
Yes.

28:53.160 --> 28:54.440
As long as you won't affect

28:54.960 --> 28:57.040
the Special Task Force's investigation,

28:57.120 --> 28:58.080
I will give you special permission

28:58.160 --> 28:59.840
to assist in the investigation
of Han Zi'ang's case.

29:00.600 --> 29:02.320
However, you must report all your actions

29:02.400 --> 29:04.040
to the team leader of the task force.

29:06.880 --> 29:07.920
Thank you, Captain.

29:08.000 --> 29:09.440
-Hold on…
-Enough.

29:11.720 --> 29:13.920
Captain, many parents are outside.

29:23.760 --> 29:25.960
I'm warning you. Don't pull
this trick often in the future.

29:41.440 --> 29:43.000
Train harder

29:43.840 --> 29:45.800
if you want to outwit me.

30:35.360 --> 30:36.920
CRIMINAL DEPARTMENT OFFICE

31:01.040 --> 31:01.880
He.

31:05.000 --> 31:06.960
He. You're awake.

31:07.040 --> 31:09.920
-Let me call a doctor.
-Wait. There's no rush.

31:10.920 --> 31:12.280
Water.

31:24.080 --> 31:24.960
Right away.

31:34.440 --> 31:35.440
How's that?

31:43.240 --> 31:44.200
Here.

31:49.840 --> 31:50.800
Brat,

31:51.440 --> 31:52.720
are you trying to scald me?

31:53.840 --> 31:54.840
Let me add some cold water.

31:54.920 --> 31:56.240
No need.

31:57.640 --> 31:59.800
-Then, I'll go and find a doctor.
-Wait.

32:02.120 --> 32:02.960
Talk to me about the case.

32:04.720 --> 32:06.040
Where's Wu Shanlong?

32:07.320 --> 32:08.840
He was pierced by steel rods

32:08.920 --> 32:10.960
and couldn't be resuscitated. He is dead.

32:17.720 --> 32:21.000
The people in the forensic department
found a small amount

32:21.080 --> 32:23.080
of human bone samples
in the bathroom's drain.

32:23.720 --> 32:25.160
After examination,

32:25.240 --> 32:27.880
it matches the DNA
found on Xu Zhihong's hair

32:27.960 --> 32:28.800
collected at Xu's apartment.

32:29.640 --> 32:30.560
Moreover,

32:30.640 --> 32:33.160
the skin samples found in the blue heels

32:33.240 --> 32:35.000
also match Xu Meng's DNA.

32:35.080 --> 32:37.120
Combined with Wu Zhengxiong's

32:37.200 --> 32:39.000
and Hu Anping's testimony…

32:39.080 --> 32:41.000
In 1997, Wu Shanlong

32:41.080 --> 32:42.440
hired Wolfie to murder someone.

32:42.520 --> 32:43.960
Wu Shanlong said

32:44.480 --> 32:47.360
he went and did the deed himself.

32:48.080 --> 32:48.960
We can basically confirm

32:50.040 --> 32:52.280
that Wu Shanlong is the murderer
of Xu Meng and her father.

32:54.280 --> 32:55.240
Are there any accomplices?

32:56.040 --> 32:56.960
None has been found at the moment.

32:59.240 --> 33:00.160
What about the motive?

33:01.080 --> 33:03.320
According to the information
we have currently,

33:03.400 --> 33:06.440
my guess is that Wu Shanlong
had a strong urge to control women

33:06.520 --> 33:08.960
due to his physiological defect.

33:09.040 --> 33:11.160
He visited the foot massage parlor
frequently with Song Qingsong.

33:11.240 --> 33:14.000
He had his eyes on Xu Meng
and wanted her to himself.

33:14.080 --> 33:14.920
MUSE FOOT MASSAGE

33:15.000 --> 33:16.720
After Song Qingsong decided
to hire him to murder the victims,

33:17.560 --> 33:19.480
Wu Shanlong lied
and used Wolfie as a scapegoat.

33:19.560 --> 33:22.080
He then purposely helped
Xu Meng and her father

33:22.160 --> 33:24.640
to disappear to escape debt.

33:24.720 --> 33:27.840
Xu Meng thought Wu Shanlong
helped her out of kindness.

33:27.920 --> 33:30.040
To her surprise, he was actually trying
to take her by force

33:30.120 --> 33:31.200
after she successfully escaped.

33:31.800 --> 33:34.200
Wu Shanlong faced resistance
from Xu Meng and her father,

33:34.280 --> 33:37.240
and he was afraid of Song Qingsong
finding out about his plan.

33:37.320 --> 33:38.640
In the end,

33:39.640 --> 33:40.880
he killed them both.

33:49.040 --> 33:50.320
Unfortunately,

33:51.640 --> 33:53.520
we couldn't find Xu Meng's body.

33:57.120 --> 34:03.120
NANSHAN BRANCH
BUILDING NO. 1, INPATIENT DEPARTMENT

34:10.679 --> 34:11.520
Xiaohe.

34:13.960 --> 34:15.000
Xiaohe!

34:32.239 --> 34:33.320
Mrs. He,

34:33.400 --> 34:34.800
you're right on time.

34:34.880 --> 34:35.920
He just woke up.

34:40.520 --> 34:41.360
Take a seat.

34:58.520 --> 34:59.440
Xiaohe.

35:09.880 --> 35:11.120
I've not seen you for ages.

35:12.040 --> 35:12.960
You've lost weight.

35:14.720 --> 35:16.240
You are in such bad shape.

35:16.320 --> 35:17.320
It's fine.

35:18.200 --> 35:19.360
Just a minor wound.

35:23.360 --> 35:24.200
Xiaohe,

35:24.920 --> 35:27.600
I've achieved something huge this time.

35:27.680 --> 35:31.360
The criminal used a steel rod this long
to stab me at this place,

35:32.040 --> 35:34.160
and I didn't even let out a groan.

35:34.240 --> 35:36.440
I even beat up the criminal.

35:40.320 --> 35:43.160
So you risked your life
just to achieve something.

35:43.880 --> 35:45.440
You are no longer young.

35:45.520 --> 35:46.880
In the future,

35:47.560 --> 35:49.480
you must take good care of yourself.

36:26.320 --> 36:27.760
I've talked to you about this.

36:40.600 --> 36:42.280
DIVORCE AGREEMENT

36:47.440 --> 36:49.320
Our marriage has become like this

36:49.840 --> 36:51.280
for a while now.

36:52.160 --> 36:54.080
It's bad for everyone if this goes on.

36:55.400 --> 36:56.960
Why not just let it go

36:57.720 --> 36:58.840
and end it cleanly?

37:09.360 --> 37:11.840
Actually, I've been trying to talk
to you about this.

37:12.840 --> 37:14.320
But I've been busy with the investigation.

37:16.360 --> 37:17.200
Give me a pen.

37:39.920 --> 37:43.080
HUSBAND'S SIGNATURE
WIFE'S SIGNATURE: SUN YUN

37:47.320 --> 37:48.360
What's wrong?

37:51.600 --> 37:54.760
CUSTODY OF THE CHILD, HE XIAOHE
GOES TO THE WIFE

37:56.480 --> 37:58.840
I'll soon transfer
to the provincial headquarters.

37:58.920 --> 38:00.040
I'll bring Xiaohe with me.

38:00.120 --> 38:03.240
This is better for her.
Look at you right now.

38:03.320 --> 38:05.320
How can you even take care of her?

38:09.880 --> 38:12.520
Xiaohe is becoming more rebellious now.

38:12.600 --> 38:14.040
If she stays here,

38:14.120 --> 38:16.680
it won't be too long
until she goes astray.

38:17.680 --> 38:19.600
You don't need to pay alimony.

38:20.120 --> 38:22.080
I can support her on my own.

38:22.160 --> 38:23.640
If you miss her,

38:23.720 --> 38:25.840
you may visit her at any time.
I won't stop you.

38:30.440 --> 38:31.840
Do you hear me?

38:33.600 --> 38:34.600
He Yuanhang.

38:36.760 --> 38:38.320
He Yuanhang!

38:41.480 --> 38:43.040
I don't object to the divorce.

38:43.560 --> 38:46.440
We all want to seek happiness,
and I have nothing to say about that.

38:46.520 --> 38:48.040
Don't use me as an excuse in the future.

38:48.120 --> 38:50.240
I'm sick of hearing,
"It's for Xiaohe's sake."

38:51.480 --> 38:53.120
I'll decide how I live my life.

38:53.640 --> 38:54.480
I'm not going to the provincial capital.

38:54.560 --> 38:57.520
Xiaohe. The adults are talking.
Don't cause any trouble.

38:58.160 --> 39:00.120
The adults also shouldn't cause
any trouble for the child.

39:00.200 --> 39:01.680
The schools in the provincial capital
are so much better

39:01.760 --> 39:02.800
than the ones in Weiyang.

39:02.880 --> 39:05.920
Attending university or studying abroad
will be so much easier in the future.

39:06.000 --> 39:08.000
Don't you like music?

39:08.080 --> 39:10.440
England. The United States. France.

39:10.520 --> 39:12.200
No matter where you want to go,
I'll also support you.

39:12.280 --> 39:13.680
I don't need anyone to decide for me.

39:13.760 --> 39:15.960
He Xiaohe. I am your guardian.

39:16.040 --> 39:17.200
As long as you are still a minor,

39:17.280 --> 39:19.480
you need my consent
before you make your decisions.

39:19.560 --> 39:20.720
This is non-negotiable.

39:20.800 --> 39:23.000
If that's the case,
it's also non-negotiable for me.

39:23.080 --> 39:24.040
I'm following Dad.

39:24.960 --> 39:27.800
Look at her. She's really stubborn,

39:27.880 --> 39:30.120
just like you.
She won't be able to turn good.

39:51.840 --> 39:54.120
CUSTODY OF THE CHILD, HE XIAOHE
GOES TO THE HUSBAND

40:04.600 --> 40:08.200
HUSBAND'S SIGNATURE: HE

40:32.000 --> 40:33.920
What is it? You don't want her to leave?

40:37.760 --> 40:40.400
Xiaohe, I have raised an amazing daughter.

40:41.000 --> 40:42.680
-Give me a hug.
-Don't be so full of yourself.

40:42.760 --> 40:45.560
Not leaving with Mom
has nothing to do with you.

40:46.720 --> 40:47.560
What do you mean?

40:47.640 --> 40:50.280
My friends, my band,

40:50.360 --> 40:51.440
and my rock career are all in Weiyang.

40:51.520 --> 40:52.800
Listen now.

40:52.880 --> 40:54.560
Leave me alone in the future.

40:54.640 --> 40:56.120
But I am your only parent now.

40:56.200 --> 40:57.400
You don't agree?

40:57.920 --> 40:59.800
Mom just left.
I'll call her back right away.

40:59.880 --> 41:01.320
I agree.

41:05.600 --> 41:06.680
I agree.

41:07.680 --> 41:08.800
Take good care of yourself.

41:09.880 --> 41:11.240
I still have lessons in the afternoon.

42:26.400 --> 42:30.480
Family is a strange thing.

42:33.280 --> 42:35.400
If the family is intact,

42:36.640 --> 42:38.400
people dig it

42:40.520 --> 42:42.760
until there's a hole.

42:43.800 --> 42:45.080
If it isn't intact,

42:47.320 --> 42:49.000
people will do their best to repair it.

42:50.600 --> 42:51.640
They will even

42:52.520 --> 42:55.520
do something as stupid
as repairing a golden bowl

42:56.600 --> 42:57.640
with a piece of tile.

43:26.840 --> 43:27.960
What is it?

43:29.000 --> 43:29.800
Take a guess.

43:33.000 --> 43:33.840
No.

43:43.200 --> 43:45.480
CERTIFICATE OF HONOR

43:45.560 --> 43:46.760
"In the June 30th case,

43:46.840 --> 43:50.080
Officer He Yuanhang demonstrated
keen investigative thinking,

43:50.160 --> 43:53.160
exceptional judgment,
a strong sense of responsibility,

43:53.240 --> 43:55.240
and extensive investigative experience.

43:55.320 --> 43:58.040
He made significant contributions
in solving the case.

44:00.040 --> 44:02.040
To commend his exemplary performance
and promote integrity,

44:02.120 --> 44:03.480
in accordance
with the People's Police Rewards

44:03.560 --> 44:04.920
and Punishments Regulations,

44:05.000 --> 44:06.600
it is submitted to the Provincial
Public Security Department

44:06.680 --> 44:10.080
that Officer He Yuanhang should be awarded
a second-class individual merit."

44:17.480 --> 44:20.160
The police station specifically
requested me to give it to you in person.

44:22.520 --> 44:25.120
SECOND-CLASS MERIT MEDAL
OF THE MINISTRY OF PUBLIC SECURITY OF PRC

44:28.960 --> 44:30.960
NAME: HE YUANHANG
MEDAL: SECOND-CLASS MERIT

44:35.440 --> 44:37.240
I get custody of my daughter

44:38.640 --> 44:40.120
and the second-class merit.

44:41.000 --> 44:42.120
Let's see

44:43.080 --> 44:44.440
who dares call me
a good-for-nothing again.

44:47.800 --> 44:50.600
What are you doing?
I'm not done admiring it.

44:56.160 --> 44:57.560
Once you recover,

44:57.640 --> 44:59.520
you must take your medications
for your condition on time.

44:59.600 --> 45:01.680
It's time to quit drinking cola.

45:01.760 --> 45:03.800
The same goes for cigarettes,
alcohol, and fatty meat.

45:04.400 --> 45:07.120
-The doctor even mentioned to--
-Enough.

45:07.200 --> 45:09.840
Stop nagging beside me. All right?

45:09.920 --> 45:11.000
You're so annoying.

45:11.520 --> 45:13.800
Go back and keep working, Deputy Captain.

45:30.040 --> 45:31.120
He.

45:31.200 --> 45:33.360
If you didn't push me away,

45:33.440 --> 45:37.000
I'd probably be the one lying here now.

45:39.200 --> 45:43.040
I told you not to nag. All right?

45:45.040 --> 45:46.280
Do you think I did it for you?

45:48.040 --> 45:49.680
I did it for myself.

45:49.760 --> 45:51.960
If I let my apprentice get hurt,

45:52.040 --> 45:55.120
it'll only make me look bad
as your mentor.

45:55.200 --> 45:56.800
It shows how incapable I am.

45:57.400 --> 45:58.800
Go away.

45:59.680 --> 46:00.960
Don't disturb my rest.

46:44.080 --> 46:45.040
I'm leaving,

46:46.080 --> 46:46.960
sir.
